    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race like it's 1999!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Budget Rally is about racing with regular cars you know and love. Have you ever wanted to push that old station wagon that handles like a boat to its limit? Or see how far that minivan can jump if you get it up to enough speed? Now you can do just that and more in this arcade style rally racing game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/906cde73e77a7d44bfe23069fe707d5d.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/906cde73e77a7d44bfe23069fe707d5d.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/906cde73e77a7d44bfe23069fe707d5d.mp4?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring aesthetics from the golden era of rally racing games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY REGULAR CARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/22979c5935b1c6140e15eb79eecb5d13.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/22979c5935b1c6140e15eb79eecb5d13.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sedans, wagons, minivans, SUVs, pickups, we've got everything!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE ON THE BACKROADS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/6f125f7cb5a24a95abcd428afd47e3d1.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/6f125f7cb5a24a95abcd428afd47e3d1.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hot deserts to snowy mountains, you are invited to a variety of different scenery to race in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTENTION TO DETAIL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/e4ab51557b9905886b5856e9a09d0fd8.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/e4ab51557b9905886b5856e9a09d0fd8.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/e4ab51557b9905886b5856e9a09d0fd8.mp4?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know how a lot of racing games feel like you are driving on a perfectly smooth surface at all times? Budget Rally has detailed suspension simulation to make tossing around that big old wagon more engaging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race like it's 1999!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Budget Rally is about racing with regular cars you know and love. Have you ever wanted to push that old station wagon that handles like a boat to its limit? Or see how far that minivan can jump if you get it up to enough speed? Now you can do just that and more in this arcade style rally racing game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/906cde73e77a7d44bfe23069fe707d5d.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/906cde73e77a7d44bfe23069fe707d5d.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/906cde73e77a7d44bfe23069fe707d5d.mp4?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring aesthetics from the golden era of rally racing games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY REGULAR CARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/22979c5935b1c6140e15eb79eecb5d13.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/22979c5935b1c6140e15eb79eecb5d13.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sedans, wagons, minivans, SUVs, pickups, we've got everything!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RACE ON THE BACKROADS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/6f125f7cb5a24a95abcd428afd47e3d1.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/6f125f7cb5a24a95abcd428afd47e3d1.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hot deserts to snowy mountains, you are invited to a variety of different scenery to race in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTENTION TO DETAIL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/e4ab51557b9905886b5856e9a09d0fd8.poster.avif?t=1745777459\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/e4ab51557b9905886b5856e9a09d0fd8.webm?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613490/extras/e4ab51557b9905886b5856e9a09d0fd8.mp4?t=1745777459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know how a lot of racing games feel like you are driving on a perfectly smooth surface at all times? Budget Rally has detailed suspension simulation to make tossing around that big old wagon more engaging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
